lue pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot4\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Bonelord%20Shield\"><img alt=\"Bonelord Shield\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Bonelord_Shield_34cfc1.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot5\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Necrotic%20Rod\"><img alt=\"Necrotic Rod\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Necrotic_Rod_0832d7.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Maps and Pictures</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"map\">\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Desert dungeon entrance\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"107\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Desert_dungeon_entrance_47ff34.jpg\" width=\"125\"/></span> <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Desert dungeon banshee\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"92\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Desert_dungeon_banshee_a52dae.jpg\" width=\"125\"/></span> </div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">6.1<br/>December 23, 2000<br/>Christmas Update 2000</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places and Loot <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p>The <b>Desert Dungeon</b> caves form a maze in which even experienced players can get lost. It is located under the <a href=\"#/wiki/Jakundaf%20Desert\">Jakundaf Desert</a>. Once in the caves, there are only two possibilities to exit the Desert Dungeon: by completing the <a href=\"#/quest/the-desert-dungeon-quest\">Desert Dungeon Quest</a> or by using the teleporter near entrance to the quest room. There are many different rooms in this maze containing different kinds of creatures which are dangerous for unprepared and inexperienced players.\n</p><p>The <a href=\"#/wiki/Desert%20Dungeon%20Library\">Desert Dungeon Library</a>, the Hall of Lost Doors, and the Teleport Room are all located here and part of the <a href=\"#/quest/the-desert-dungeon-quest\">Desert Dungeon Quest</a>. The dungeon also houses three NPCs, the necromancer <a href=\"#/wiki/Adrenius\">Adrenius</a>, the adventurer <a href=\"#/wiki/Hagor\">Hagor</a>, and the blind <a href=\"#/wiki/Nemal\">Nemal</a>, who also play their roles in the quest.\n</p><p>There are still many mysteries and possibly unsolved puzzles found here. It is where you will find the famous unreachable room with a lever and a teleport, guarded by a single <a href=\"#/wiki/Banshee\">Banshee</a> (<a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32619,32100,12\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32619, 32100, 12)</a>), as well as mysterious books, keys, levers and switch tiles.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Desert Dungeon</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: cente